<SiteLayout title="Contact" description="Contact Kroma Digital about a business problem or digital tool.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Contact</span><h1>Tell us the problem first.</h1><p>You do not need to know what kind of app you need. Tell us what is difficult, repetitive, slow, or easy to get wrong in your current workflow.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="wrap"><div class="grid"><article class="card"><h2>Message Kroma Digital</h2><p>Facebook Messenger is currently the simplest way to contact us. We welcome practical feedback and information about real business problems in Cambodia.</p><a class="btn" href="https://www.facebook.com/kromadigitalapps" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open Kroma Digital on Facebook</a></article><article class="card"><h2>Useful things to tell us</h2><p>What you currently manage, what part causes problems, how you handle it today, how often it happens, and what a better outcome would look like.</p><p>We use this information to understand the problem before deciding whether software is the right solution.</p></article></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>